      "id": "962bf09d-7af8-4d81-9ad3-1702a5a48d0d",
      "item_id": "753b7826-74b7-4925-af33-6062a1864c4c",
      "summary": "FDA Import Alert 33-15 authorizes the Detention Without Physical Examination (DWPE) of mini-cup gel and jelly candies that contain konjac, carrageenan, agar-agar, or other firm gelling agents. These candies pose a serious choking hazard due to their size, shape, slipperiness, and firm consistency, which prevents them from dissolving easily. Consequently, these products are deemed adulterated and unfit for food. The alert provides a Red List of foreign manufacturers whose shipments are subject to immediate detention upon offering for importation into the U.S.",
